# A safety net for the import tools: exports of the source workbooks, a filled-in private
# configuration and saved emulator state never belong in this public repository. Their place is
# portal/.private/, which the repository's own ignore rules cover. The documented format of the
# configuration is sources.example.json, which stays.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.ods
*.csv
*.tsv
sources.json
emulator-data/
firebase-export-*/
